      "en": "Though I have taught and strengthened their arms, yet they plot evil against me.",
      "ko": "내가 저희 팔을 연습시켜 강건케 하였으나 저희는 내게 대하여 악을 꾀하는도다",
      "source_text_hash": "605b6df4270e73e463973d54e77db7bef94fbebeefcb8c736b265515fef3084b",
